## Golden: omen numérico y judge exhaustivo.
omen Phase:
    Ready is 0
    Loading is 1
    Done is 2

weave label with p as Phase into string:
    if p == Ready:
        return "ready"
    else if p == Loading:
        return "loading"
    return "done"

weave main into int:
    calling print with calling label with Loading
    calling print with "\n"
    return 0
